<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Welcome to medisync - Admin</title>
    <style>
      body { background: #99e2b4; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .container { background: #fff; max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); padding: 40px 30px 30px 30px; text-align: center; }
      .brand { font-size: 2.2em; font-weight: bold; color: #56ab91; margin-bottom: 10px; font-family: 'Segoe Script', cursive, sans-serif; }
      .subtitle { font-size: 1em; color: #358f80; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
      h1 { font-size: 1.7em; color: #333333; margin-bottom: 10px; }
      .divider { width: 60px; height: 3px; background: #56ab91; margin: 0 auto 20px auto; border-radius: 2px; }
      .message { color: #358f80; font-size: 1.1em; margin-bottom: 30px; }
      .footer { color: #78c6a3; font-size: 0.95em; margin-top: 30px; text-align: center; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="brand">medisync</div>
      <div class="subtitle">Welcome, Admin!</div>
      <h1>Welcome to medisync, <%= userName %>!</h1>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div class="message">
        Thank you for joining the medisync team as an administrator.<br>
        You now have access to the admin dashboard where you can manage doctors, appointments, and users.<br>
        If you have any questions or need support, please contact our team.
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        medisync | 123 Health Ave, Suite 100 | Your City, Country
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html> 